    "reviews": "\u201cThis is something to be experienced, not played, and as far as emergent narratives are concerned, this is the best example of that I've seen in many, many years.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 DigitallyDownloaded net(review for Nintendo Switch)<br><br>\u201cI've played a lot of video games in my life, but I don't know that I've ever quite played one like this.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 Hey Poor Player  (review for Nintendo Switch)<br><br>\u201cThis feels like the culmination of the sightseeing-style open world, a true milestone in the genre.\u201d<br>IGN JAPAN<br>",
